        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jan Borgman\n- Organizations: University of Groningen\n- Places: Groningen, Netherlands\n- Roles: Astronomer, university administrator, professor of astronomical observation technique\n\nFacts:\n- The University of Groningen is a public research university in the city of Groningen in the Netherlands.\n- The University of Groningen was founded in 1614 and is one of the oldest and largest universities in the Netherlands.\n- Jan Borgman was born on 30 November 1929 and is a Dutch astronomer and university administrator.\n- Jan Borgman was professor of astronomical observation technique at the University of Groningen from 1968 to 1988.",
